<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ to TEPCO's straight bonds.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ to TEPCO's straight bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Thursday it had assigned an AA+ rating to Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc's (TEPCO) 150 billion yen worth of 2.8 percent domestic straight bonds due in 2006 as well as to its 50 billion yen worth of 3.45 percent domestic bonds due in 2016.</p>
<p>It said the outlook for the bonds was stable.</p>
</text>
